# the screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c): WHERE is the office, the hour, the day, who sings and the preset, then the
# page; events are said as they happen; a knob as it turns; a page once it settles; a preset as it changes
wait 200
listen
wait 100
said Lauds, 05:30, day 1, singing. Preset Abbey Chapel. Day 1
tap ARP
wait 300
said Brothers page: Abbot Benedict
tap GLO
wait 300
said Setup page: Day 2 h, Tune 0, MIDI out Off, Lights On
spin K1 -1
wait 300
said Day 1 h
turn SELECT -1
wait 300
said Space page: Echo 14, Size 94, Colour 48, Ambience None
tap HOME
tapkey w2
wait 100
said Br. Ambrose stood to sing
where
said Lauds
turn PRESET 1
said PRESET CATHEDRAL
where
said Preset Cathedral
turn PRESET -1
speakdump
